			setBorder(BorderFactory.createCompoundBorder(
				BorderFactory.createMatteBorder(0, selected ? 3 : 0, 0, 0, PackCheckTheme.ACCENT),
				BorderFactory.createCompoundBorder(
					BorderFactory.createMatteBorder(0, 0, 1, 0, PackCheckTheme.BORDER),
					BorderFactory.createEmptyBorder(6, 8, 6, 8))));
			setToolTipText(preset.method);
			return this;
		}

		private static String compactListText(String text)
		{
			if (text == null)
			{
				return "";
			}
			text = text.replace('\u2013', '-').replace('\u2014', '-');
			text = text.startsWith("Tombs of Amascut - ") ? text.substring(19)
				: text.startsWith("Theatre of Blood - ") ? text.substring(19)
				: text.startsWith("Chambers of Xeric - ") ? text.substring(20) : text;
			return text;
		}
	}

	private static String escape(String text)
	{
		if (text == null)
		{
			return "";
		}
		return text.replace("&", "&amp;").replace("<", "&lt;").replace(">", "&gt;")
			.replace("\"", "&quot;");
	}
}

package com.packcheck.ui;

import com.packcheck.model.LocationScope;
import com.packcheck.model.MatchOption;
import com.packcheck.model.MeasurementType;
import com.packcheck.model.PackRequirement;
import java.awt.Component;
import java.awt.Dimension;
import java.awt.GridBagConstraints;
import java.awt.GridBagLayout;
import java.awt.Insets;
import java.text.ParseException;
import java.util.ArrayList;
import javax.swing.JCheckBox;
import javax.swing.JComboBox;
import javax.swing.JLabel;
import javax.swing.JOptionPane;
import javax.swing.JPanel;
import javax.swing.JScrollPane;
import javax.swing.JSpinner;
import javax.swing.JTextArea;
import javax.swing.JTextField;
import javax.swing.SpinnerNumberModel;

final class RequirementEditorDialog
{
	private RequirementEditorDialog()
	{
	}

	static PackRequirement edit(Component parent, PackRequirement original)
	{
		PackRequirement copy = original.copy();
		JTextField name = new JTextField(copy.displayName, 24);
		JCheckBox required = new JCheckBox("Required (unchecked = optional)", copy.required);
		JCheckBox enabled = new JCheckBox("Enabled (unchecked = ignored override)", copy.enabled);
		JComboBox<LocationScope> location = new JComboBox<>(LocationScope.values());
		location.setSelectedItem(copy.location);
		JComboBox<MeasurementType> measurement = new JComboBox<>(MeasurementType.values());
		measurement.setSelectedItem(copy.measurement);
		JSpinner minimum = new JSpinner(new SpinnerNumberModel(copy.minimum, 0, 1_000_000_000, 1));
		JTextField exact = new JTextField(copy.exact == null ? "" : copy.exact.toString(), 8);
		JTextField maximum = new JTextField(copy.maximum == null ? "" : copy.maximum.toString(), 8);
		JTextField equipmentSlot = new JTextField(copy.requiredEquipmentSlot == null ? "" : copy.requiredEquipmentSlot.toString(), 8);
		JTextField inventorySlot = new JTextField(copy.fixedInventorySlot == null ? "" : Integer.toString(copy.fixedInventorySlot + 1), 8);
		JTextField recommendation = new JTextField(copy.recommendation == null ? "" : copy.recommendation, 24);
		JSpinner recommendedSlots = new JSpinner(new SpinnerNumberModel(copy.recommendedSlots, 0, 28, 1));
		JTextArea alternatives = new JTextArea(formatAlternatives(copy), 7, 30);
		alternatives.setLineWrap(false);
		JTextArea notes = new JTextArea(copy.notes == null ? "" : copy.notes, 3, 30);
		notes.setLineWrap(true);
		notes.setWrapStyleWord(true);

		JPanel panel = new JPanel(new GridBagLayout());
		GridBagConstraints constraints = new GridBagConstraints();
		constraints.insets = new Insets(3, 3, 3, 3);
		constraints.fill = GridBagConstraints.HORIZONTAL;
		constraints.weightx = 1;
		int row = 0;
		row = addRow(panel, constraints, row, "Display name", name);
		row = addWide(panel, constraints, row, required);
		row = addWide(panel, constraints, row, enabled);
		row = addRow(panel, constraints, row, "Location", location);
		row = addRow(panel, constraints, row, "Measurement", measurement);
		row = addRow(panel, constraints, row, "Minimum", minimum);
		row = addRow(panel, constraints, row, "Exact (optional)", exact);
		row = addRow(panel, constraints, row, "Maximum (optional)", maximum);
		row = addRow(panel, constraints, row, "Equipment slot 0-13", equipmentSlot);
		row = addRow(panel, constraints, row, "Inventory slot 1-28", inventorySlot);
		row = addRow(panel, constraints, row, "Packing target", recommendation);
		row = addRow(panel, constraints, row, "Inventory slots in plan", recommendedSlots);
		row = addWide(panel, constraints, row, new JLabel("Alternatives, one per line:"));
		row = addWide(panel, constraints, row, new JLabel("item:ID,ID|Label|variations  or  family:key|Label"));
		row = addWide(panel, constraints, row, new JScrollPane(alternatives));
		row = addWide(panel, constraints, row, new JLabel("Notes"));
		addWide(panel, constraints, row, new JScrollPane(notes));
		JScrollPane scrollPane = new JScrollPane(panel);
		scrollPane.setPreferredSize(new Dimension(520, 620));

		while (true)
		{
			int result = JOptionPane.showConfirmDialog(parent, scrollPane, "Edit requirement",
				JOptionPane.OK_CANCEL_OPTION, JOptionPane.PLAIN_MESSAGE);
			if (result != JOptionPane.OK_OPTION)
			{
				return null;
			}
			try
			{
				try
				{
					minimum.commitEdit();
				}
				catch (ParseException exception)
				{
					throw new IllegalArgumentException("Minimum must be a whole number", exception);
				}
				copy.displayName = requireText(name.getText(), "Display name");
				copy.required = required.isSelected();
				copy.enabled = enabled.isSelected();
				copy.location = (LocationScope) location.getSelectedItem();
				copy.measurement = (MeasurementType) measurement.getSelectedItem();
				copy.minimum = (Integer) minimum.getValue();
				copy.exact = optionalInteger(exact.getText(), "Exact quantity", 0, Integer.MAX_VALUE);
				copy.maximum = optionalInteger(maximum.getText(), "Maximum quantity", 0, Integer.MAX_VALUE);
				copy.requiredEquipmentSlot = optionalInteger(equipmentSlot.getText(), "Equipment slot", 0, 13);
				Integer shownInventorySlot = optionalInteger(inventorySlot.getText(), "Inventory slot", 1, 28);
				copy.fixedInventorySlot = shownInventorySlot == null ? null : shownInventorySlot - 1;
				copy.recommendation = recommendation.getText().trim();
				copy.recommendedSlots = (Integer) recommendedSlots.getValue();
				copy.alternatives = parseAlternatives(alternatives.getText(),
					copy.measurement == MeasurementType.MANUAL_CONFIRMATION);
				copy.notes = notes.getText().trim();
				if (copy.exact != null && copy.maximum != null)
				{
					throw new IllegalArgumentException("Use exact or maximum, not both");
				}
				return copy;
			}
			catch (IllegalArgumentException exception)
			{
				JOptionPane.showMessageDialog(parent, exception.getMessage(), "Invalid requirement",
					JOptionPane.ERROR_MESSAGE);
			}
		}
	}

	private static String formatAlternatives(PackRequirement requirement)
	{
		StringBuilder text = new StringBuilder();
		for (MatchOption option : requirement.alternatives)
		{
			if (text.length() > 0)
			{
				text.append('\n');
			}
			if (option.familyKey != null)
			{
				text.append("family:").append(option.familyKey);
			}
			else
			{
				text.append("item:");
				for (int index = 0; index < option.itemIds.size(); index++)
				{
					if (index > 0)
					{
						text.append(',');
					}
					text.append(option.itemIds.get(index));
				}
			}
			text.append('|').append(option.label == null ? "Item" : option.label);
			if (option.matchVariations)
			{
				text.append("|variations");
			}
		}
		return text.toString();
	}

	private static ArrayList<MatchOption> parseAlternatives(String text, boolean allowEmpty)
	{
		ArrayList<MatchOption> parsed = new ArrayList<>();
		for (String rawLine : text.split("\\R"))
		{
			String line = rawLine.trim();
			if (line.isEmpty())
			{
				continue;
			}
			String[] parts = line.split("\\|", -1);
			String matcher = parts[0].trim();
			MatchOption option = new MatchOption();
			option.label = parts.length > 1 && !parts[1].trim().isEmpty() ? parts[1].trim() : matcher;
			option.matchVariations = parts.length > 2 && "variations".equalsIgnoreCase(parts[2].trim());
			if (matcher.startsWith("family:"))
			{
				option.familyKey = requireText(matcher.substring("family:".length()), "Family key");
			}
			else if (matcher.startsWith("item:"))
			{
				for (String itemId : matcher.substring("item:".length()).split(","))
				{
					option.itemIds.add(parseInteger(itemId.trim(), "Item ID", 1, Integer.MAX_VALUE));
				}
			}
			else
			{
				throw new IllegalArgumentException("Alternative must start with item: or family: — " + line);
			}
			parsed.add(option);
		}
		if (parsed.isEmpty() && !allowEmpty)
		{
			throw new IllegalArgumentException("Add at least one stable item or family alternative");
		}
		return parsed;
	}

	private static int addRow(JPanel panel, GridBagConstraints constraints, int row, String label, Component component)
	{
		constraints.gridy = row;
		constraints.gridx = 0;
		constraints.weightx = 0;
		panel.add(new JLabel(label), constraints);
		constraints.gridx = 1;
		constraints.weightx = 1;
		panel.add(component, constraints);
		return row + 1;
	}

	private static int addWide(JPanel panel, GridBagConstraints constraints, int row, Component component)
	{
		constraints.gridy = row;
		constraints.gridx = 0;
		constraints.gridwidth = 2;
		constraints.weightx = 1;
		panel.add(component, constraints);
		constraints.gridwidth = 1;
		return row + 1;
	}

	private static Integer optionalInteger(String text, String field, int minimum, int maximum)
	{
		String value = text.trim();
		return value.isEmpty() ? null : parseInteger(value, field, minimum, maximum);
	}

	private static int parseInteger(String text, String field, int minimum, int maximum)
	{
		try
		{
			int value = Integer.parseInt(text);
			if (value < minimum || value > maximum)
			{
				throw new IllegalArgumentException(field + " must be between " + minimum + " and " + maximum);
			}
			return value;
		}
		catch (NumberFormatException exception)
		{
			throw new IllegalArgumentException(field + " must be a whole number", exception);
		}
	}

	private static String requireText(String text, String field)
	{
		String value = text == null ? "" : text.trim();
		if (value.isEmpty())
		{
			throw new IllegalArgumentException(field + " is required");
		}
		return value;
	}
}

